      <title>研究实践IPD多年，我终于想通了「先僵化」</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek001/post/20260909/%E7%A0%94%E7%A9%B6%E5%AE%9E%E8%B7%B5IPD%E5%A4%9A%E5%B9%B4%E6%88%91%E7%BB%88%E4%BA%8E%E6%83%B3%E9%80%9A%E4%BA%86%E5%85%88%E5%83%B5%E5%8C%96/</link>
